    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken in the Third, a mysterious world filled with dozens of unique enemies and environments. Using only a slingshot, can you fight your way to victory, when a single hit can kill you?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SKILL BASED PROGRESSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no powerups or leveling systems. Progression is tied solely to your skill as a player. And in a world where most enemies die in a single hit, this means constantly adapting to new attack and movement patterns. From sandfish that leap out of the ground to snowballs that split apart when you hit them, each enemy offers a unique challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484610/extras/d55c032af7ee992616bae24c9a4e9862.poster.avif?t=1753953181\" width=616 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484610/extras/d55c032af7ee992616bae24c9a4e9862.webm?t=1753953181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484610/extras/d55c032af7ee992616bae24c9a4e9862.mp4?t=1753953181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BATTLE SINGULARITIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face enormous machines with ever shifting weak points and methods of attack. Each machine felled unlocks a new region to explore and new enemies to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484610/extras/463e13a1b70ed1c6261998850e33d421.poster.avif?t=1753953181\" width=616 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484610/extras/463e13a1b70ed1c6261998850e33d421.webm?t=1753953181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484610/extras/463e13a1b70ed1c6261998850e33d421.mp4?t=1753953181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE DIVERSE WORLDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From sprawling cityscapes to desolate wastelands, discover dozens of unique environments spread across 7 regions. And with new side quests, mechanics, and enemies in each region, Akashic Slingshot offers a huge amount of content just waiting to be discovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484610/extras/4dad7f77885a15570564a7404bf1e320.poster.avif?t=1753953181\" width=616 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484610/extras/4dad7f77885a15570564a7404bf1e320.webm?t=1753953181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484610/extras/4dad7f77885a15570564a7404bf1e320.mp4?t=1753953181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPECT THE UNEXPECTED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you play, the more the world will change. Where do the limits of this game truly lie?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484610/extras/be6f5f25119f48ddb39898f8e2dbdbaa.poster.avif?t=1753953181\" width=800 height=71 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484610/extras/be6f5f25119f48ddb39898f8e2dbdbaa.webm?t=1753953181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
