team/apps/3484610/extras/463e13a1b70ed1c6261998850e33d421.webm?t=1753953181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484610/extras/463e13a1b70ed1c6261998850e33d421.mp4?t=1753953181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE DIVERSE WORLDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From sprawling cityscapes to desolate wastelands, discover dozens of unique environments spread across 7 regions. And with new side quests, mechanics, and enemies in each region, Akashic Slingshot offers a huge amount of content just waiting to be discovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484610/extras/4dad7f77885a15570564a7404bf1e320.poster.avif?t=1753953181\" width=616 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484610/extras/4dad7f77885a15570564a7404bf1e320.webm?t=1753953181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484610/extras/4dad7f77885a15570564a7404bf1e320.mp4?t=1753953181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPECT THE UNEXPECTED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you play, the more the world will change. Where do the limits of this game truly lie?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484610/extras/be6f5f25119f48ddb39898f8e2dbdbaa.poster.avif?t=1753953181\" width=800 height=71 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484610/extras/be6f5f25119f48ddb39898f8e2dbdbaa.webm?t=1753953181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
